Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P3.8 STAGSLCT stage sweep aids

DW3_FORCE_STAGE from MODE_STAGE_SELECT; DW3_AUTO_STAGE_RETURN back to
STAGSLCT; STAGE_SWEEP_PASS / DW3_STAGE_SWEEP_EXIT. Seed party on
MODE_STAGE_SELECT boot. Allocate StageSelectWindows children; stub
BIOS ROM read; skip TASK_KILL cursor requestMode when FORCE_STAGE set.

--- a/src/debug/stage_select/stage_select.c
